<section class="sec" id="curriculum">
<div class="wrap">
<span class="eyebrow reveal">The full course</span>
<h2 class="st reveal">Curriculum, projects and <span class="serif">tools.</span></h2>
<p class="lede reveal">Week-by-week structure, what past learners built, and every tool you'll touch hands-on. Curriculum 10 · Projects 3 · Tools 12.</p>
<div class="cur-wrap">
<div class="cur-main">
<div class="ctabs" role="tablist">
<button aria-selected="true" class="ctab on" data-tab="cp-cur" role="tab">Curriculum <span class="n">10</span></button>
<button aria-selected="false" class="ctab" data-tab="cp-prj" role="tab">Projects <span class="n">3</span></button>
<button aria-selected="false" class="ctab" data-tab="cp-tools" role="tab">Tools <span class="n">12</span></button>
</div>
<div class="cpanel on" id="cp-cur">
<div class="acc reveal">
<details open=""><summary><span class="mno">M01</span><span class="mtitle">SAP &amp; finance foundations</span><span class="mmeta">26 hrs · Wk 1-2</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Navigating SAP GUI, SAP Fiori and the S/4HANA system</li><li>Enterprise Structure: company, company code, business area</li><li>The Universal Journal (ACDOCA) and how S/4HANA Finance differs from ECC</li><li>Document types, posting keys and the field status concept</li><li>Mini-project: configure a company code from scratch</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M02</span><span class="mtitle">General Ledger (FI-GL)</span><span class="mmeta">28 hrs · Wk 2-4</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Chart of accounts and GL account master records</li><li>General Ledger Accounting, ledgers and parallel accounting</li><li>Document splitting and real-time integration</li><li>Posting, parking, holding and reversing documents</li><li>Hands-on: a full set of GL postings on a live system</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M03</span><span class="mtitle">Accounts Payable (FI-AP)</span><span class="mmeta">24 hrs · Wk 4-6</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Business Partner setup, vendor master and reconciliation accounts</li><li>Invoices, credit memos, down payments and special GL</li><li>The Automatic Payment Program (F110) end to end</li><li>Withholding tax / TDS configuration</li><li>The procure-to-pay flow from a finance seat</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M04</span><span class="mtitle">Accounts Receivable (FI-AR)</span><span class="mmeta">22 hrs · Wk 6-7</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Business Partner setup, customer master and credit master data</li><li>Incoming payments, clearing and residual items</li><li>Dunning configuration and dunning runs</li><li>Credit management basics</li><li>The order-to-cash flow from a finance seat</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M05</span><span class="mtitle">Asset Accounting (FI-AA)</span><span class="mmeta">24 hrs · Wk 7-9</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>New Asset Accounting in S/4HANA</li><li>Chart of depreciation, asset classes, account determination</li><li>Acquisition, transfer, retirement and scrapping</li><li>Depreciation runs and parallel valuation</li><li>Hands-on: a full asset lifecycle</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M06</span><span class="mtitle">Bank Accounting &amp; period close</span><span class="mmeta">24 hrs · Wk 9-11</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>House banks, bank master and payment methods</li><li>Manual and electronic bank statement, reconciliation</li><li>Month-end and year-end closing cockpit</li><li>Financial Statement Version and reporting</li><li>Foreign currency valuation</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M07</span><span class="mtitle">Taxes: GST, TDS &amp; GCC VAT</span><span class="mmeta">18 hrs · Wk 11-12</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Tax on sales and purchases, tax procedures</li><li>GST configuration for India</li><li>TDS / withholding tax in practice</li><li>GCC VAT for Middle East rollouts</li><li>Tax reporting and reconciliation</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M08</span><span class="mtitle">Controlling (CO)</span><span class="mmeta">26 hrs · Wk 12-15</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Cost element and cost centre accounting</li><li>Internal orders and settlement</li><li>Profit Centre Accounting</li><li>Margin Analysis (account-based CO-PA) in S/4HANA</li><li>Product costing fundamentals</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M09</span><span class="mtitle">Integration: FI-MM &amp; FI-SD</span><span class="mmeta">24 hrs · Wk 15-17</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Procure-to-pay: GR/IR and automatic account determination (OBYC)</li><li>Order-to-cash: SD billing flowing to accounting</li><li>Reconciliation between modules</li><li>The integration tickets recruiters test you on</li><li>Hands-on: post an MM and an SD cycle to FI</li></ul></div></details>
<details><summary><span class="mno">M10</span><span class="mtitle">S/4HANA Finance, Fiori &amp; capstone</span><span class="mmeta">24 hrs · Wk 17-20</span> <span class="plus">+</span></summary><div class="ab"><ul><li>Universal Journal deep dive and embedded analytics</li><li>Fiori apps for finance and live reporting</li><li>Central Finance and migration concepts (overview)</li><li>Transport requests and the SAP landscape</li><li>Capstone: an end-to-end S/4HANA Finance implementation</li></ul></div></details>
</div>
</div>
