<div class="cmp reveal">
<div class="cmp-head"><span>What matters</span><span>Typical online EdTech</span><span class="ck">Cokonet Academy</span></div>
<div class="cmp-row"><span class="w">Govt recognition</span><span class="x">✕ Self-issued, not recognised.</span><span class="ok">✓ SAP-aligned · C_TS4FI_2023 certification track.</span></div>
